msgstr "ລົດຖີບພັບໄດ້ 6 ເກຍ ຂະໜາດກະທັດຮັດ ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບການເດີນທາງໃນຕົວເມືອງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:product.template,description:bike_shop.product_template_9
msgid ""
"Complete safety check, brake tuning, drivetrain cleaning and adjustment, "
"tire pressure check, wheel truing, and final road test. For\n"
"            road, city, gravel or mountain bikes (non-electric)."
msgstr ""
"ກວດກາຄວາມປອດໄພຄົບຊຸດ, ປັບຕັ້ງເບຣກ, ອະນາໄມ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຊຸດຂັບເຄື່ອນ, ກວດກາຄວາມດັນລົມຢາງ, "
"ດັດສູນລໍ້, ແລະ ທົດລອງຂີ່ຕົວຈິງ. ສຳລັບ\n"
"            ລົດຖີບທາງຮາບ, ລົດຖີບເມືອງ, gravel ຫຼື ລົດຖີບພູເຂົາ (ແບບບໍ່ມີໄຟຟ້າ)."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Complete the repair and maintenance worksheet using a Worksheet Template "
"(e.g., checklist of performed\n"
"                        operations, technician name, signature field,...). "
"The client can sign it upon collection."
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນໃບລາຍງານການສ້ອມແປງ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນໂດຍໃຊ້ ຮູບແບບໃບງານ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ລາຍການກວດເຊັກວຽກທີ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ,\n"
"                        ຊື່ຊ່າງເຕັກນິກ, ຊ່ອງລາຍເຊັນ,...). "
"ລູກຄ້າສາມາດເຊັນຮັບໄດ້ໃນເວລາມາຮັບລົດ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Configure your website to present your bike catalog, services, and brand "
"mission with a clean and structured\n"
"                        layout."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອນຳສະເໜີລາຍການລົດຖີບ, ບໍລິການ, ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງແບຣນ "
"ດ້ວຍການຈັດວາງໜ້າຕາ\n"
"                        ທີ່ສະອາດຕາ ແລະ ເປັນລະບຽບຮຽບຮ້ອຍ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Confirm the Sales Order to trigger the appropriate actions:"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍເພື່ອເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:website.page,name:bike_shop.page_contactus
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a Purchase Order from the Purchase app when specific parts (e.g., "
"tires, brakes) are running low."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ຈາກແອັບການຈັດຊື້ (Purchase) ເມື່ອອາໄຫຼ່ບາງລາຍການ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຢາງ, ເບຣກ) ໃກ້ຈະໝົດ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a ticket to verify the warranty or answer support questions. You can "
"automate ticket creation by\n"
"                        sharing specialized email aliases (e.g., "
"warranties@bike-shop.example.com or help@qfr-bike-leasing.example.com)\n"
"                        which turn incoming messages into tickets "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງທິກເກັດ (Ticket) ເພື່ອກວດສອບການຮັບປະກັນ ຫຼື ຕອບຄຳຖາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າການສ້າງທິກເກັດແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍ\n"
"                        ການແບ່ງປັນຊື່ຫຼິ້ນອີເມວສະເພາະ (ເຊັ່ນ: warranties@bike-"
"shop.example.com ຫຼື help@qfr-bike-leasing.example.com)\n"
"                        ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສົ່ງເຂົ້າມາໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນທິກເກັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:product.template,name:bike_shop.product_template_15
msgid "Cube Kathmandu Hybrid"
msgstr "Cube Kathmandu Hybrid"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:product.template,name:bike_shop.product_template_16
msgid "Cube Reaction Pro"
msgstr "Cube Reaction Pro"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Customize your project stages in the “Workshop” project: add columns like "
"“Waiting for Parts” to better\n"
"                        track blocked repairs waiting for a parts delivery, "
"or “Ready for Pick-Up\" when the repair is done."
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານໃນໂຄງການ “Workshop” (ໂຮງຊ່າງ): ເພີ່ມຖັນ ເຊັ່ນ: “ລໍຖ້າອາໄຫຼ່” "
"ເພື່ອ\n"
"                        ຕິດຕາມວຽກສ້ອມແປງທີ່ຕິດຂັດຍ້ອນລໍຖ້າອາໄຫຼ່, ຫຼື “ພ້ອມຮັບລົດແລ້ວ\" "
"ເມື່ອສ້ອມແປງສຳເລັດ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:project.task.type,name:bike_shop.project_task_type_12
msgid "Delivered"
msgstr "ຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Do you want to go further?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຶກສາເພີ່ມຕື່ມບໍ່?"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Drag and drop leads through pipeline stages (e.g., <i>New</i>, <i>Qualified</"
"i>, <i>Proposition</i>) and\n"
"                        launch a specific quote directly inside the card by "
"clicking the <b>\"New Quotation\"</b> button, which links\n"
"                        the CRM history directly to the Sales app."
msgstr ""
"ລາກ ແລະ ວາງລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງໄປຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນການຂາຍ (ເຊັ່ນ: <i>ໃໝ່</i>, <i>ຜ່ານການກັ່ນຕອງ</i>, "
"<i>ຍື່ນຂໍ້ສະເໜີ</i>) ແລະ\n"
"                        ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາສະເພາະໂດຍກົງພາຍໃນບັດ ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ "
"<b>\"ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃໝ່\"</b>, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່\n"
"                        ປະຫວັດ CRM ໂດຍກົງໄປຍັງແອັບການຂາຍ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_contactus
