#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Get expert help with warranty claims, repairs, and after-sales support for "
"your bike."
msgstr ""
"ຮັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຈາກຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານກ່ຽວກັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການຮັບປະກັນ, ການສ້ອມແປງ, ແລະ "
"ບໍລິການຫຼັງການຂາຍສຳລັບລົດຖີບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to the Inventory app and open the product (e.g., brake pads). Use the "
"Smart Buttons on the product page\n"
"                        to access the Reordering Rules."
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ແອັບ Inventory (ສາງສິນຄ້າ) ແລ້ວເປີດລາຍການສິນຄ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຜ້າເບຣກ). ໃຊ້ Smart Button "
"ຢູ່ໜ້າສິນຄ້າ\n"
"                        ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງກົດລະບຽບການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນ (Reordering Rules)."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:bike_shop.product_attribute_value_5
msgid "Green"
msgstr "ສີຂຽວ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Handle Services of Repairs and Maintenance, as well as customized long-term "
"leasing options through the Sales app,\n"
"                with integration to CRM, planning, inventory, and "
"communication tools."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການບໍລິການສ້ອມແປງ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, "
"ລວມທັງທາງເລືອກການເຊົ່າໄລຍະຍາວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຜ່ານແອັບການຂາຍ,\n"
"                ດ້ວຍການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ CRM, ການວາງແຜນ, ສາງສິນຄ້າ, ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືສື່ສານຕ່າງໆ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Handle all repair, maintenance, and long-term asset inspections efficiently "
"with the Planning and Project apps."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການທຸກການສ້ອມແປງ, ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ແລະ ການກວດກາຊັບສິນໄລຍະຍາວໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບດ້ວຍແອັບ "
"Planning ແລະ Project."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Handle warranty cases through the Helpdesk app:"
msgstr "ຈັດການກໍລະນີການຮັບປະກັນຜ່ານແອັບ Helpdesk:"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:website.page,name:bike_shop.page_home
msgid "Home"
msgstr "ໜ້າຫຼັກ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid ""
"If your bike has seen better days, or you're simply ready for an upgrade, "
"explore our full range of bikes online. From city cruisers to performance "
"road bikes, find the perfect match for your next adventure."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລົດຖີບຂອງທ່ານເກົ່າຫຼາຍແລ້ວ, ຫຼື ທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດຄັນໃໝ່, "
"ເຂົ້າໄປເບິ່ງລາຍການລົດຖີບທັງໝົດຂອງພວກເຮົາທາງອອນລາຍໄດ້ເລີຍ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ລົດຖີບຂີ່ຫຼິ້ນໃນເມືອງ "
"ຈົນຮອດລົດຖີບທາງຮາບສະມັດຖະນະສູງ, ຊອກຫາຄູ່ໃຈທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຜະຈົນໄພຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:project.task.type,name:bike_shop.project_task_type_9
msgid "In Progress"
msgstr "ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In the Contact app, manage your preferred vendors and set reminders/warnings "
"if there is a minimum order\n"
"                        amount required to get free transport costs."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແອັບ Contact (ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່), ຈັດການຜູ້ສະໜອງຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕັ້ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ/ຄຳເຕືອນຖ້າມີຍອດສັ່ງຊື້\n"
"                        ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄ່າຂົນສົ່ງຟຣີ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:product.template,description:bike_shop.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Includes full bike safety check, brake and gear adjustment, battery and "
"electrical components diagnostics and updates, wheel alignment, and test "
"ride. Designed for e-bikes and Brompton\n"
"            models."
msgstr ""
"ຮວມການກວດກາຄວາມປອດໄພທົ່ວຄັນ, ປັບຕັ້ງເບຣກ ແລະ ເກຍ, ກວດວິນິດໄສ ແລະ "
"ອັບເດດແບັດເຕີຣີລວມທັງລະບົບໄຟຟ້າ, ດັດສູນລໍ້, ແລະ ທົດລອງຂີ່ຕົວຈິງ. ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບລົດຖີບໄຟຟ້າ ແລະ "
"ລົດຖີບ\n"
"            Brompton."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:product.template,name:bike_shop.product_template_22
msgid "Inner Tube – 700x25 Presta Valve"
msgstr "ຢາງໃນ – 700x25 ຫົວຈຸບ Presta"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Inventory &amp; Stock Replenishment"
msgstr "ສາງສິນຄ້າ &amp; ການເຕີມສະຕັອກ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Inventory levels update automatically after each sale."
msgstr "ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຈະອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການຂາຍແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_contactus
msgid "John Doe"
msgstr "John Doe"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid ""
"Keep your bike in perfect condition with our professional repair and "
"maintenance services. Whether it's a quick adjustment or a full overhaul, "
"our expert mechanics ensure your bike stays safe, high-performing, and "
"enjoyable to ride. We service all types of bikes with care and precision."
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາລົດຖີບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນສະພາບສົມບູນແບບສະເໝີ ດ້ວຍບໍລິການສ້ອມແປງ ແລະ "
"ບຳລຸງຮັກສາລະດັບມືອາຊີບຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການປັບແຕ່ງເລັກນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ການຍົກເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ, "
"ຊ່າງຊ່ຽວຊານຂອງພວກເຮົາຮັບປະກັນວ່າລົດຖີບຂອງທ່ານຈະປອດໄພ, ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເຕັມປະສິດທິພາບ, ແລະ ຂີ່ມ່ວນ. "
"ພວກເຮົາໃຫ້ບໍລິການລົດຖີບທຸກປະເພດດ້ວຍຄວາມໃສ່ໃຈ ແລະ ລະອຽດຮອບຄອບ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:product.template,name:bike_shop.product_template_23
msgid "LED Light Set"
msgstr "ຊຸດໄຟ LED"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Let Odoo handle reorders automatically. When forecasted stock drops below "
"the minimum, Odoo will generate a\n"
"                        Purchase Order based on your settings."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ Odoo ຈັດການການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເມື່ອສະຕັອກທີ່ຄາດການໄວ້ຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າຍອດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ, Odoo "
"ຈະສ້າງ\n"
"                        ໃບສັ່ງຊື້ (Purchase Order) ຂຶ້ນມາຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:product.template,description:bike_shop.product_template_22
msgid ""
"Lightweight but durable inner tube for 700c road tires. 42mm Presta valve."
msgstr "ຢາງໃນນ້ຳໜັກເບົາແຕ່ທົນທານ ສຳລັບຢາງລົດຖີບທາງຮາບຂະໜາດ 700c. ຫົວຈຸບ Presta 42 ມມ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:bike_shop.product_template_16
msgid "Lightweight hardtail MTB ideal for cross-country adventures."
msgstr "ລົດຖີບພູເຂົາ Hardtail ນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ເໝາະສຳລັບການຜະຈົນໄພແບບ Cross-Country."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Link the ticket to the related Sales Order Line and the matching Workshop "
"task (e.g. repair on the client’s\n"
"                        Cube bike). Move the ticket to the “Sent to Brand” "
"column and use an Email Template to contact the brand for\n"
"                        warranty confirmation."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງທິກເກັດກັບລາຍການໃບສັ່ງຂາຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ ວຽກໂຮງຊ່າງທີ່ກົງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການສ້ອມແປງລົດຖີບ\n"
"                        Cube ຂອງລູກຄ້າ). ຍ້າຍທິກເກັດໄປທີ່ຖັນ “ສົ່ງໃຫ້ແບຣນແລ້ວ” ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບອີເມວເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ຫາແບຣນສຳລັບ\n"
"                        ການຢືນຢັນການຮັບປະກັນ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.footer_custom
msgid "LinkedIn"
msgstr "LinkedIn"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid "Long-tail, front-box, 45 km/h pedelecs"
msgstr "ລົດຖີບແບບຫາງຍາວ (Long-tail), ກະບະໜ້າ, pedelecs ຄວາມໄວ 45 ກມ/ຊມ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid "MAINTENANCE PACKAGES"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

