#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Manage Orders via the Sales App"
msgstr "ຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຜ່ານແອັບການຂາຍ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage bike parts, showroom items, and long-term rental stock efficiently "
"using the Purchase and Inventory apps to\n"
"                avoid shortages and streamline restocking."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການອາໄຫຼ່ລົດຖີບ, ສິນຄ້າໃນຫ້ອງວາງສະແດງ, ແລະ "
"ສະຕັອກສຳລັບເຊົ່າໄລຍະຍາວໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ແອັບ Purchase ແລະ Inventory ເພື່ອ\n"
"                ປ້ອງກັນສິນຄ້າຂາດສະຕັອກ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຕີມສິນຄ້າສະດວກວ່ອງໄວ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage in-store transactions for bikes, accessories, or specific parts with "
"the Point of Sale (PoS) app."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການທຸລະກຳການຊື້-ຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານສຳລັບລົດຖີບ, ອຸປະກອນເສີມ, ຫຼື ອາໄຫຼ່ສະເພາະ ດ້ວຍແອັບຈຸດຂາຍ (PoS)."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing Orders"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Manual Purchase Orders"
msgstr "ໃບສັ່ງຊື້ສ້າງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Mark the task as Done when completed. Once all tasks linked to the Sales "
"Order are in this stage, a\n"
"                        notification email will automatically be sent to the "
"customer confirming that their bike is ready."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍວຽກວ່າ ສຳເລັດ (Done) ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ. "
"ເມື່ອທຸກໆວຽກທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບໃບສັ່ງຂາຍຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້,\n"
"                        ອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະຖືກສົ່ງຫາລູກຄ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າລົດຖີບຂອງພວກເຂົາພ້ອມແລ້ວ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid "Mechanical bikes · road, city, MTB"
msgstr "ລົດຖີບທຳມະດາ · ທາງຮາບ, ເມືອງ, ລົດຖີບພູເຂົາ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_about
msgid "Monday-Saturday<br/>10:00 - 18:00"
msgstr "ຈັນ-ເສົາ<br/>10:00 - 18:00"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid "Most services are&amp;nbsp;done the same week you drop off."
msgstr "ບໍລິການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນ&amp;nbsp;ສຳເລັດພາຍໃນອາທິດດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ທ່ານເອົາມາສົ່ງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model:project.task.type,name:bike_shop.project_task_type_8
msgid "New"
msgstr "ໃໝ່"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_about
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Nothing beats a proper fitting, a hands-on repair, or just talking bikes "
"over a coffee. Our Brussels workshop is open all week."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງດີໄປກວ່າການໄດ້ປັບແຕ່ງລົດໃຫ້ພໍດີຕົວແທ້ໆ, ການລົງມືສ້ອມແປງຕົວຈິງ, ຫຼື "
"ພຽງແຕ່ມານັ່ງດື່ມກາເຟລົມເລື່ອງລົດຖີບ. ໂຮງຊ່າງຂອງພວກເຮົາທີ່ Brussels ເປີດບໍລິການຕະຫຼອດອາທິດ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_home
msgid "OUR BRANDS"
msgstr "ແບຣນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically schedules a service or assembly slot in the <b>Planning "
"app</b> and generates a delivery slip\n"
"                    tracking the bike's serial number in the Inventory app."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ຈະຈັດຕາຕະລາງເວລາບໍລິການ ຫຼື ປະກອບລົດໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ <b>ແອັບ Planning</b> ແລະ "
"ສ້າງໃບຈັດສົ່ງ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມໝາຍເລກຊີຣຽວຂອງລົດຖີບໃນແອັບ Inventory."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo is entirely integrated into an App. Download it to turn your phone into "
"a tool to manage your entire\n"
"                        workflow."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຂົ້າກັນຢ່າງສົມບູນໃນຮູບແບບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ດາວໂຫຼດເລີຍເພື່ອປ່ຽນໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືໃນການຈັດການ\n"
"                        ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free to add new apps,\n"
"                delete/modify demo data, and test everything around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນວ່າ ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່,\n"
"                ລຶບ/ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ, ແລະ ທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ!"

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid "On all labor and parts we fit."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນທັງຄ່າແຮງງານ ແລະ ອາໄຫຼ່ທຸກຊິ້ນທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once the purchase is confirmed, send the Request for Quotation (RFQ) via "
"email or confirm it manually."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອການສັ່ງຊື້ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ສົ່ງໃບຮ້ອງຂໍໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ (RFQ) ຜ່ານທາງອີເມວ ຫຼື ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.view_page_maintenance_repairs
msgid ""
"One fixed price per bike type. Consumables and environmental contributions "
"included, what's listed is what you pay."
msgstr ""
"ລາຄາດຽວຄົງທີ່ຕາມແຕ່ລະປະເພດລົດຖີບ. ຮວມຄ່າວັດສະດຸສິ້ນເປືອງ ແລະ ຄ່າທຳນຽມສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມແລ້ວ, "
"ລາຄາທີ່ສະແດງຄືລາຄາທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈ່າຍຕົວຈິງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <b>Planning app</b> to check your assigned repair shifts, scheduled "
"jobs, or workshop priorities."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <b>ແອັບ Planning</b> ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງກະວຽກສ້ອມແປງທີ່ຖືກມອບໝາຍ, ວຽກທີ່ມີຕາຕະລາງໄວ້, ຫຼື "
"ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນໂຮງຊ່າງ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Point of Sale App and start a session by clicking on your register."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບຈຸດຂາຍ (PoS) ແລະ ເລີ່ມຮອບການຂາຍໂດຍການກົດໃສ່ເຄື່ອງບັນທຶກເງິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bike_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bike_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Sales app from the main dashboard to view generated documents, or "
"create a Sales Order manually by\n"
"                        setting the required fields for a subscription "
"(Customer, Pricelist / Recurring, Until, and Products)."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການຂາຍ (Sales) ຈາກໜ້າຫຼັກເພື່ອເບິ່ງເອກະສານທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຂາຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍ\n"
"                        ການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ (ລູກຄ້າ, "
